    answer:
      "Yes. Number porting is a standard, regulated process in Australia — your existing local or 1300/1800 number moves to the new VoIP provider. Porting typically takes from a few days to a few weeks; the key rule is to never cancel your old service until the port has completed, or you can lose the number.",
